			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"傑克"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200630101,
					"content": "唉，真想親眼看看吶…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630102,
					"content": "看什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200630103,
					"content": "#嗚哇，{F#妳}{M#你}是什麼時候來的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630104,
					"content": "是這樣，史丹利先生昨天喝了頓好酒，跟我講了他經歷過的一場冒險，就在<color=#00E1FFFF>達達烏帕谷</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630105,
					"content": "他是這麼說的：「…那個怪物猛烈地燃燒著，無定型的龐大身軀緩慢地蠕動，無論我怎麼攻擊，如何怒吼，它只挪了挪它那恐怖的巨眼，仿佛是在對我投以最極致的蔑視…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630106,
					"content": "雖然我沒有親眼見過，但是連史丹利先生都陷入了苦戰，那肯定是一場十分偉大的冒險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630107,
					"content": "唉，真想去找找看那個讓史丹利先生都陷入苦戰的怪物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630108,
					"content": "但是就憑我的實力，十之八九會被打得只顧逃跑了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630109,
					"content": "#對了，如果{F#妳}{M#你}有興趣的話…願意幫我去找找那隻怪物嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630110,
						200630112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630110,
					"content": "我知道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200630111,
					"content": "#真是可靠！那麼就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630112,
					"content": "我可以陪你去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200630113,
					"content": "#如果可以的話，我也真的想跟著{F#妳}{M#你}去，但是還有很多雜事等著我去做。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630114,
					"content": "什麼雜事？蒙德城裡的冒險家協會這個情況，只是進行冒險的話，收入完全不夠用啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630115,
					"content": "所以還會幫居民們做各種事，例如找貓啦，拔草啦之類的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630116,
					"content": "#這場偉大的冒險就交給{F#妳}{M#你}了，找到了之後，一定要回來詳細地告訴我啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006302,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2006301
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
